    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Yeoas Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai ŋituŋa a Yudaya yaut Yeoas lokoku a Yosia kituruwosi erwosit, kilunyokin lokicoloŋ a papa keŋ alo Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Yeoas ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiuni apaki ŋina esyakinia akipuka Yudaya; kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋilapyo ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Neko erwosit a Ijipit toen Yeoas, ya iwace alo Yerusalem, toreik ŋituŋa a Yudaya akitac ocur neni keŋ, totacae neni keŋ ŋatalantae amiat ŋulu ke esilipa ka etalantait ŋolo ke egolid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilunyok Neko ŋolo arae erwosit a Ijipit Eliakim lokaato a Yosia toruwor erwosit a Yudaya ka Yerusalem, kilocok tari ekiro keŋ toruwor Yeoiakim; nai ya Neko Yeoas Ijipit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Apukan a Yeoiakim ka akikamaro keŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Yeoiakim ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan apaki ŋina esyakinia akipuka Yudaya. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋitomon ka epei. Abu iŋes kitiya ŋakiro ŋuna aronok aneni ke Ekapolon Akuj keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Nebukadinesar erwosit a Babilon bu kikama akwap a Yudaya, toroc Yeoiakim ŋakejen a ŋiriko a ŋulu etiyatae a eburonis, ikotere ya iŋes Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ Nebukadinesar tolema ŋiboro ŋice alo Kai ke Ekapolon, ya Babilon kiwuak kai ka akuj keŋ alo Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo a Yeoiakim ŋuluce daadaŋ, ŋakiro ŋuna ka asiilyo ŋuna etiyat iŋes ka daadaŋ ŋuna etoroniyaritere iŋes, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael ka Yudaya. Abu nai Yeoiakin kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Yudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Apukan ka akikamaro a Yeoiakin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Yeoiakin ŋitomon ka ŋikanikauni apaki ŋina esyakinia akipuka Yudaya. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋilapyo ŋiuni ka ŋirwa ŋitomon. Etiyat iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna aronok aneni ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli ŋirwa ŋulu ka akicereet ekaru ŋol, abu erwosit Nebukadinesar kiyakiya ŋituŋa aomere Yeoiakin ka aponi yaarae iŋes Babilon kaapei ka ŋiboro ŋulu epol egyelit, ŋulu ayakasi Kai ke Ekapolon. Kilunyok Nebukadinesar Sedekia lokaato a Yeoiakin lokicoloŋ toruwor erwosit a Yudaya ka Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Sedekia Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Sedekia ŋatomoniarei ka epei apaki ŋina esyakinia akipuka Yudaya. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋitomon ka epei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyat iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna aronok aneni ke Ekapolon Akuj keŋ. Abu iŋes toŋer akitiditeun bon aneni a Yeremia a ekadwaran a ŋolo abu kirwor ŋakiro ke Ekapolon neni keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ Sedekia toŋer Nebukadinesar ŋolo sek abu kisikoŋ alokiro ka Akuj atemar iwuapi ŋakiro a Nabukadinesar; abu iŋes kitogogoŋ akou keŋ ka kitininik ŋatameta keŋ towou akiwuap ŋuna a Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋisacaradotin daadaŋ ŋulu apolokinito ŋuluce kaapei ka ŋituŋa ŋuluce daadaŋ toruwor nooi ŋulu pa ekinyoma. Apotu kiwuapa ŋakiro ŋuna asiilyanak daadaŋ ŋuna etiyaete ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a ŋunace, aŋun, apotu kitorona Akai ke Ekapolon alo Yerusalem ŋina sek aris Ekapolon kitaleu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tomunaarae Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon Akuj atapapaa a ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka Yerusalem torubak iyakiyanari ŋikadwarak akisirworiun ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka Yerusalem, anerae esyonit Akuj ikes kaapei ka Akai keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ikes tokienatar ŋikadwarak ŋulu ka Akuj, toŋero ŋakiro ka Akuj ŋuna erworosi ŋikadwarak ka tojamuwasi ŋikadwarak ŋulu ka Akuj akitodol ŋina abunio anyunyura ka Akuj ŋina apolon nooi lotuŋa keŋ ŋul, todaun epite ece ŋolo eiunotor ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Akuj tocamak erwosit a Babilon ebuni akirem ikes. Abu toar ŋisorok kec anakibois kec a ŋina asegan, abu nyisyon esorokit, kori asorokit, ekasikout, kori akimat, kori ituŋanan idio daadaŋ ŋini apalag. Abu Akuj kipotok ŋituŋa ŋul daadaŋ neni a Nebukadinesar toar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya Nebukadinesar Babilon ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu ka Akai ka Akuj, ŋulu apolok ka ŋulucicik, ebari ŋolo ka Akai ka Akuj, ebari ŋolo ke erwosit ka ŋolo a ŋikapolok a ŋuluce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋibabiloniyae kicunya Akai ka Akuj, toritakis arwatata a Yerusalem kwap ka kicunyasi ŋakais ŋuna ka apukan daadaŋ ka tomunaasi ŋiboro ŋulu apol egyelit daadaŋ alo Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toriko Nebukadinesar Babilon ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu keponi nyeari, ido apotu ŋul toruwor ŋiketiyak keŋ ka ŋulu a ŋidwe keŋ a ŋulusapa akitodol ŋina esyakinere apukan ŋina a Perisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ŋakiro ke Ekapolon ŋuna erworo ekadwaran Yeremia kiyookinos. Abala Yeremia ebe, “Idoŋi akwap a Yudaya emam ŋituŋa ŋikaru ŋatomonikanikaarei, ikotere etacakin lorwa ŋulu a Sabato, anerae kepotu ŋituŋa tojoŋoto akieŋunun ŋirwa ŋulu a Sabato.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisera Kirus ŋakiro ŋuna ka alacakino a ŋirikon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a epei ipukat erwosit Kirus Perisia, abu Ekapolon kisiyook ŋakiro ŋuna sek alimunit iŋes aneni a ekadwaran Yeremia. Abu Ekapolon kiwuak lotau a erwosit Kirus a ŋolo a Perisia, alimun ŋakiro ŋuna aponi kigirae ka kiyakiyarae tosyomae ikeunitae ŋakiro keŋ neni a ŋituŋa a apukan keŋ a daadaŋ. Abasi ŋakiro ebe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
